### List sports
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sports?page=1&limit=10

### Search sports
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sports?q=Monsoon

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sports/sports-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/sports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Last Ticket Sport",
  "sport": "Football",
  "venue": "Indoor Stadium",
  "date": "2026-12-08",
  "price": 249
}
